# Admin conventions

## Patterns
- Pages under `src/app/(admin)/admin/…`; APIs under `/api/v1/admin/…`.
- Auth: `withAuth` + `PERMISSIONS.*` (e.g. `MARKETING_WRITE`).
- Responses: `apiSuccess` / `apiError`; validate with Zod.
- Wire new sections into `AdminSidebar`.

## UX
- Filters should be practical: search + dropdowns, normalized values, real facet counts.
- Bulk/import jobs: progress bar, chunked writes, clear success/error toasts.
- Prefer appealing, scannable layouts (cards/tables) over bare dense tables when listing people/entities.

## Data
- Store DB (`MONGODB_URI`) vs leads CRM DB (`MONGODB_LEADS_URI`) stay separate — do not mix models across connections.
- Optional fields OK; skip duplicate emails/phones on lead import.
